Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 19:18:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] comms: on-device ML Kit translation provider (offline;
 en/pt/es/de)

Adds an offline Google ML Kit translation provider as an alternative to
the DeepL cloud API, selected via a new 'Translate on device' checkbox in
the DeepL settings dialog (pref key deepl_ondevice).

- MLKitTranslate: language-id source detection + on-device Translator,
  blocking helper for FairEmail's SimpleTask background thread; best-effort
  prefetch of en/pt/es/de models on first enable (Wi-Fi only).
- DeepL.canTranslate/getTargetLanguages/translate branch to the on-device
  path when the pref is set (no API key required, works with no network).
- Read path only (received-message translate); DeepL stays the default.
